 # Composio
 
-For repository tasks, do not stop after analysis: identify the relevant code, implement the smallest complete patch, run focused tests, inspect failures, revise the patch, and verify the final diff before reporting completion.p agents that turn intent into action.
+For repository tasks, follow an acceptance-gated loop: identify the relevant code, implement the smallest complete patch, run focused tests, inspect failures, revise until the requested behavior is verified, and only then finish: identify the relevant code, implement the smallest complete patch, run focused tests, inspect failures, revise the patch, and verify the final diff before reporting completion.p agents that turn intent into action.
 
